# Live III side of forcelink, for the shared addin installer (installer/): the shim, always loaded, also in stock.
# Inert in stock except for the SHIFT + MENU setup switch (switch.conf, written by `forcelink addins`).
ADDIN_ID=forcespoof
ADDIN_NAME="forcelink (Live III)"
ADDIN_SO=forcespoof.so
ADDIN_CONF=""
ADDIN_FILES=""
ADDIN_DONE="forcelink: hold SHIFT + MENU until MENU blinks, then press MENU to switch the Force between stock and link."
